%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081.jpg" srcset="https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081_hu_42eac4e85af273e0.jpg 800w, https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/177493081.jpg 1378w" width="1378"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;两张图片的图片模式调整为RGB，这样才能编辑&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="调整为RGB.jpg" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="435px" data-flex-grow="181" height="342" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/557492129.jpg" width="621"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将图层解锁，图像宽度设置为原来的宽度/1.3333333333333(相当于压缩了图片宽度，legacy模式开机时会自动把图片拉伸，UEFI模式则不需要此操作)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="ps压缩图片宽度.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="503px" data-flex-grow="209" height="492" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200.jpg" srcset="https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200_hu_2cecdde8a532bb36.jpg 800w, https://juju306.github.io/p/%E5%AF%B9ami-bios%E5%9B%BA%E4%BB%B6%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%BC%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%B8%A4%E7%A7%8D%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95/2056595200.jpg 1032w" width="1032"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;将六芒星图层复制到1.bmp图片中&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="复制图层.JPG" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="455px" data-flex-grow=